  "notes": [
    "Title placeholder in the .potx inherits 32pt Arial from the master. The builder overrides it to 20pt so a two-line action title fits the 1.049in box.",
    "Content region stops at y=6.549 so the source line at y=6.60 clears the 'Environment Agency - Abu Dhabi' footer at y=7.00 and the page number at y=6.951.",
    "A full-width 0.022in green rule sits on every content layout at y=1.456. Do not draw over it.",
    "Layouts 'Content Pattern Green/Blue' are excluded: their title box is only 7.16in wide because of the side graphic, which cannot hold an action title.",
    "chart_palette is not the raw brand palette. The template's own accents fail a colour-blind separation check when used as chart series: 004B87 sits outside the lightness band, 869CAE and 006269 read as grey. The brand green 007749 passes and is kept as series one; the remaining slots were re-stepped until all six checks pass. Fourth slot 9AA84F warns on contrast, which is why data labels are on by default."
  ]
